<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56874" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρκος</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tail</i> of a beast (not a bird),
			e.g. swine, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				785
			</span></i>; dog, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρκῳ σαίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					1031
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. λαγῶ</span> a hare's
			<i>scut</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				909
			</span></i>; horse, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				254d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sert.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; of all sorts of beasts, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				689b2
			</span></i>, al.; of fishes, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				565b29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κ. ποιεῖ καλῶς</span>, of
			omens in sacrificing, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1054
			</span></i>, cf. Sch. ad loc., <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				130
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>membrum virile</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				239
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀνώνυμος κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					5.45
				</span></i>
			; of an animal, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. βοός</span>, used
			as a tawse, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.68
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>handle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>small animal that injures the vine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλεκτρυών</span>
			, Id. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>tongue</i> of flame, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1257
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
